Package: mug-bot
Version: __VERSION__
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-venv, python3-pip
Maintainer: MonChoon <choonboy@gmail.com>
Description: Mug Bot - Torn item-market monitor + Discord alerts
 Self-hosted FastAPI ingest server plus a discord.py bot. Receives data forwarded from
 actively-viewed Torn item-market pages, detects sales, computes mug values, and posts
 alerts to Discord. Runs as a systemd service (mug-bot.service).
